                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.102H/319: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-10-05T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 5,
                                1917—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your October 1, 8 p.m. Requested authority to negotiate is granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
